==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[tea-cup]]
* [[tea cup]]

===Etymology===
{{compound|tea|cup}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/tiː.kʌp/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A small [[cup]], with a [[handle]], used for [[drinking]] [[tea]]; normally sits in a [[saucer]] as part of a [[tea set]].
# A unit of [[measure]]; a [[teacupful]].

